name: One approved model lesson draft, explicit review, protected allowance and recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_generation.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/open.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SELECTED FINDING | source-finding
submit: lessons
require-live-snap: 25 REUSABLE LESSONS | lessons
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE LESSON DRAFT | generation-plan
expect: One lesson job
ask: Does planning keep generation separate from human acceptance and context reuse, with one job, recorded source and no model request before approval?
keys: t
type: 2
keys: Enter r
type: 1
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_generation.py draft @TMP_TARGET @ART
resize: 160x48
live-snap: plan-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: plan-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: plan-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: plan-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: plan-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: plan-40x12-last
ask: Across six sizes, is the complete plan readable by paging with model, spending, protected Review, options and back controls available?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-last
expect: 1 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 2
ask: Does approval bind exactly one job and one attempt to the original confirmation, selected model and two total calls, with one protected Review call and uncertain dollar consumption?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved lesson job | approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | before-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_generation.py finished @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 job(s) · 1 completed | completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATED LESSON DRAFT | generation-result
expect: Inspect model-proposed lesson
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled model lesson | saved-draft
expect: Proposed by:
ask: Does the actual executor expose only a model draft, with model and source omissions disclosed, unchanged finding decisions and explicit later human acceptance?
keys: a
paste-file: @ART/reason.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM ACCEPTED LESSON | acceptance-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Accepted · Labeled model | accepted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_generation.py accepted @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 job(s) · 1 completed | recovered-job
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATED LESSON DRAFT | recovered-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Accepted · Labeled model | recovered-lesson
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_generation.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does restart authenticate the original generated revision and preserve acceptance and consumed allowance without another model request or job?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
